    "headline": "VA Awards Salesforce $1.6B Contract to Transform Veteran Care and Services",
    "summary": "SAN FRANCISCO & WASHINGTON, July 24, 2026--Salesforce, the world’s #1 Agentic CRM, today announced that the U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs (VA) has awarded the company, through its distribution network, a $1.6 billion, three-year, Agentic Enterprise License Agreement (AELA).* Through the agreement, VA will leverage Missionforce to modernize care and service delivery and help provide more timely, consistent, and connected experiences for America’s Veterans.",
